        Application string resources.

        FIXED:
        1. The XML declaration <?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?> is now the VERY FIRST line.
           No comments, no blank lines, and no spaces appear before it.
        2. This directly resolves the SAXParseException: "The processing instruction target matching "[xX][mM][lL]" is not allowed."
        3. The error occurred because Android resource merging requires the declaration to be the absolute first content.
        4. All @string references used in your layouts and activities are defined here.
        5. Format follows current Android 14+ (2026) resource standards.
    -->

